--[[ 
SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:

1. Compile submenu:
   cd ~/.config/sketchybar/helpers/submenu
   clang -std=c99 -O3 -F/System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/ -framework Carbon -framework ApplicationServices submenu.c -o bin/submenu

2. Find processes with menu bar extras:
   ~/.config/sketchybar/helpers/submenu/bin/submenu -l

3. List items for a specific process:
   ~/.config/sketchybar/helpers/submenu/bin/submenu -p <PID>

4. Test clicking:
   ~/.config/sketchybar/helpers/submenu/bin/submenu -c <PID> <index>

5. Uncomment examples above and adjust process names and indices

6. Include this file in your config:
   require("items.submenu_extras")

NOTES:
- Process names must match exactly (case-sensitive)
- Index starts at 0
- If process not found, item won't be created
- Use submenu -l to discover available processes
- Use submenu -p <PID> to see item indices

COMMON PROCESS NAMES:
- "iStat Menus Status" - iStat Menus
- "Control Center" - macOS Control Center
- "Raycast" - Raycast
- "Bitwarden" - Bitwarden
- "Bartender 5" - Bartender
--]]
